<description><![CDATA[<div>每周的订阅邮件中，我们会附上值得大家阅读的 <a href="?q=%23%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0">#推荐文章</a> 。以下是<a href="https://mailchi.mp/2577df74d2dd/k-17456202" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">本周邮件</a>中的推荐阅读列表：<br/><br/>BBC News 中文 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9pz2xh" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国开始打击AI恋爱关系，是过度干预还是先见之明？</a><br/><blockquote>中国重拳打击AI恋爱：严禁未成年人接触虚拟伴侣，AI每两小时必须声明自己并非人类。</blockquote><br/><br/>【404文库】新闻哥 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9pz2g5" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">我考不过你，还举报不过你吗？</a><br/><blockquote>举报好朋友用违规电器，只因保研排位差0.16分，大学生正把“思想品德”考核变成清除对手的利器。</blockquote><br/><br/>端传媒 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9pz2g8" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">北京理工大学解聘裴轶：「巧克力属性」争议、举报信与女权课停课</a><br/><blockquote>北理教师裴轶被解聘：因一句“巧克力”遭举报，她曾追问七个常委里该有几个女性。</blockquote><br/><br/>报人刘亚东 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9pz2gc" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">谁在透支新闻的公信力？</a><br/><blockquote>夫妻合谋敲诈被误报为“毒菜中毒”，在抢发有奖的流量规则下，真相正一次次被情绪埋掉。</blockquote><br/><br/>竹禾堂纪事 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9pz2gf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">舞台上的“即兴走动”，会不会被处罚？</a><br/><blockquote>郭德纲因即兴改词被举报罚款，商演内容必须逐字报批，现场脱离脚本的发挥均属违规。</blockquote><br/><br/>纽约时报 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9pz2gj" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">“中国制造”背后的声音：在农民工文学里读懂中国</a><br/><blockquote>56岁外卖员获鲁迅文学奖，4亿农民工正通过文字戳破“努力就能过上好生活”的时代承诺。</blockquote><br/><br/>纽约时报 | <a href="https://outsight.pse.is/9pz2gl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国当局为何要求中学生读《简·爱》？</a><br/><blockquote>中国要求九年级必读《简·爱》，因其女主结婚生子的结局契合官方应对人口下降、鼓励婚育的愿景。</blockquote><br/><br/>欢迎大家推荐我们的邮件周报给身边不方便科学上网的朋友，订阅链接：<a href="https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/TqrAgUZ7dg8-VVe6s1wQRh2n7cNXvEyfbDqKYHF7616rgJ0IoxflbBjadZLv_vHcyJNz7cMi_ye6TdeSnss2yyLlnhcAcOLlG9GWXL5jwofeu1oPg1hn-rvkSqEHa6xIf4ycNi_ox6xLCD2dTunqFl9_eARu_8DnLu3eRgAsbRYJt-BvUcg9l80c34JrilWMUbi0akXfyJr48gcwLsXE0bno-a0IZmaohnOE4fnh3m1jbsaRjWpzv6y9HG50QQ7VYvANe5k7HlduKKDNQXzbs8_C87x__Xg_SOiTI8vm9PJUBDm7jWlpFqnq25YrtxguZnZnh6RBSixWfYVFdWXefg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
